<title>USA: CBOE to list options on Hertz Corp May 9.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list options on Hertz Corp May 9.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Friday it will list options on Hertz Corp stock May 9.</p>
<p>The options will trade on the March expiration cycle, with introductory expiries in June, July, September and December. Initial strike prices are set at 25, 30 and 35, the CBOE said. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750)) E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
